stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TopLayerReset
    TopLayerReset --> TopLayerInitialize: reset command
    TopLayerInitialize --> TopLayerConnect: mirrored config accepted
    TopLayerConnect --> TopLayerKeepAliveServerSend: connect proven and keepalive may start
    TopLayerKeepAliveServerSend --> TopLayerKeepAliveClientReturn: server keepalive transmitted
    TopLayerKeepAliveClientReturn --> TopLayerKeepAliveServerSend: valid client return received

    TopLayerConnect --> TopLayerError: TopLayer failures >= 3
    TopLayerKeepAliveServerSend --> TopLayerError: TopLayer failures >= 3
    TopLayerKeepAliveClientReturn --> TopLayerError: TopLayer failures >= 3
    TopLayerError --> TopLayerReset: explicit Reset Communication

    note right of TopLayerConnect
      BottomLayer auto-retry window:
      - max 3 retries
      - checksum failure retry
      - transport reconnect retry
      Retry exhaustion escalates into TopLayer failure handling.
    end note
